{
 "key": "SPEC-1",
 "fields": {
  "summary": "Patient search results unmount and remount on every keystroke, causing multi-second UI stalls and heap growth",
  "issuetype": {
   "name": "Bug"
  },
  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2,
      "localId": "97c4eb041c54"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Symptom"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "In the patient search (both the compact dropdown and the advanced search page), every keystroke that changes the query causes the entire rendered banner list to unmount and remount. With ~50 accumulated patient banners (e.g. five auto-paginated pages of ten), this:"
      }
     ],
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "d037d4394264"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "bulletList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "f53b8ee7600e"
       },
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "triggers ~150 simultaneous backend requests (per-banner "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "/obs",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": " photo lookup, "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "/visit",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ", "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "/person",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ") within a few ms"
          }
         ],
         "attrs": {
          "localId": "ed0d5a72d198"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "1c0b5e1fd197"
       },
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "blocks the JS main thread long enough that the next keystroke event sits in the event queue for multiple seconds before dispatching"
          }
         ],
         "attrs": {
          "localId": "184fe8c82de2"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "2121c96a4e36"
       },
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "accumulates promise-reaction / SWR-subscriber state in the heap that does not appear to be released"
          }
         ],
         "attrs": {
          "localId": "4eca657f8a7c"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "b1d3e7928ec1"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "In one captured session, a single keypress took 3.7 s to register as a network request, and three Firefox heap snapshots taken seconds apart showed "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "mCallback",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " edges growing 75k → 153k → 458k."
      }
     ],
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "d88e7b577099"
     }
    },
